<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for getting in touch with us.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If lower tier received upgrade add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I regret we were unable to meet your request for an upgrade on your flight QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c} on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c},&nbsp;and can understand your confusion when your <b>-<i>colleague/wife/husband/travelling companion etc-</i></b><i> </i>was upgraded instead.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have checked your booking and can assure you that your upgrade request was not ignored.<b> <i>-Advise outcome of investigation.-</i></b></font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Nonetheless, we do realise that this is an area of frustration for our customers and we are continually reviewing the process. Your comments will help us improve our service.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If points taken for upgrade not provided add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I regret we were unable to meet your request for an upgrade on your flight QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c} on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}, and can understand your confusion when your points were mistakenly deducted. Please accept our apology for the error.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have spoken with our Frequent Flyer Service Centre and can confirm the Qantas Points have now been refunded.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I can assure you that this has been investigated by our management team to ensure the fault is fixed, so we appreciate you taking the time to let us know what happened.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If empty seats add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I regret we were unable to meet your request for an upgrade on your flight QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c} on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}, and can understand your confusion when you saw that seats were available in the Business Class cabin.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have checked your booking and can assure you that your upgrade request was not ignored. Empty Business Class seats on your flight can be the result of seats that were sold and subsequently not used by late arrivals to the airport, delayed connections, or customers who cancelled their seats after the upgrade requests were processed.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Nonetheless, we do realise that this is an area of frustration for our customers and we are continually reviewing the process. Your comments will help us improve our service.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for taking the time to write to us. We appreciate your ongoing loyalty and we hope to see you on board again in the future.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: white;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>